  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Marcus, I've reset your MFA. Here's how it went:\n\n- I tried to verify you with a call to the mobile number on your HR record. Nobody answered, which makes sense if the phone is lost.\n- I then asked your manager, Helena Brandt, to attest that it's you. She approved it.\n- After that I removed the old device (the iPhone 15) from your account.\n\nAt your next sign-in, you'll be asked to register a new MFA device. Use your new phone or another device you control.\n\nI'd also report the lost phone to the service desk so it can be dealt with as a lost asset. Good luck with the board meeting."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that's a relief. I didn't know Helena had been pulled in, but good call. I'm still in the middle of getting ready for the board, so I'll just say the process here was slow and I'm not thrilled about it.\n\nI don't have a new phone yet, so I'll grab one on the way. I'll sign in and register it when I'm set up. Who do I contact about the lost phone, and is there anything I need to do with the taxi company or the carrier?"
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "get_asset",
   "args": {
